Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Compute balance growth on fiscal year ends only

asset_growth and equity_growth compared any balance with the prior
fiscal year's balance, so an interim balance against the previous year
end was stored as annual growth while measuring a few months. Balance
growth now needs a fiscal year end (a date some FY flow ends on) and the
exact prior year end, the day before that fiscal year starts.

